title: "agri-agronomy-core"
abstract: >-
  Offline, deterministic data contract and resolution engine for
  cultivation knowledge. The engine reads a versioned knowledge pack,
  verifies its hash, and returns deterministic outcomes; the data
  itself lives in the separate agri-knowledge repository.
type: software
authors:
